# Data files (scans, rocks dbs, parquet outputs)
# These match scan output directories and stray data files. The
# patterns without trailing slashes match both files AND directories
# of the same name, so e.g. *.parquet covers `<scan>.rocks.parquet/`
# (the streaming Parquet sibling directory) and also stray .parquet
# files. Likewise *.rocks/ catches RocksDB scan dirs.
*.rocks/
*.parquet
parquet-output/
*.sst
*.log
*.docx
